INT. WHOLESALE FLOWER MARKET - 4 A.M.

Concrete floor slick with water and petals. Buckets of peonies, ranunculus, lilies stacked to the ceiling. Forklifts beep somewhere in the vaulted dark. The air smells green and cold.

AURELIO FONTANA (30s, florist, rolled sleeves, thorn scratches on his forearms) lifts a bucket of white ranunculus in each hand and sets them on his cart. BEATRIX HALLORAN (30s, rival florist, canvas apron, sleeves tied around her waist) reaches for the same stems and comes up with his hand.

They freeze. The bucket tips between them, spilling cold water over both their boots. He lunges to save it and she lunges at the same instant, and they collide, and white petals burst into the air like startled birds.

AURELIO
Those were mine.

BEATRIX
They were on the floor.

AURELIO
In my bucket.

BEATRIX
In a puddle.

JUN (20s, market porter, headphones, a hand truck) rolls past, glances at them, and rolls on without comment.

Aurelio's phone buzzes in his apron. He fishes it out and puts it to his ear.

NONNA (V.O.)
(over phone)
Aurelio? Aurelio, the roses, did you get the roses?

AURELIO
Nonna, it's four in the morning.

NONNA (V.O.)
(over phone)
The wedding is at eleven. A wedding doesn't care what time it is.

AURELIO
I know. I'm at the market right now.

NONNA (V.O.)
(over phone)
Who are you with? I hear a girl.

Beatrix covers a laugh. Aurelio turns his shoulder, and Beatrix picks a ranunculus from the floor and tucks it behind his ear while he is distracted.

AURELIO
(into phone)
A colleague, Nonna.

NONNA (V.O.)
(over phone)
Is she pretty?

AURELIO
I'll call you back.

He hangs up. He pulls the flower from his ear, studies it, doesn't give it back.

BEATRIX
You can keep the ranunculus. But I'm taking the peonies.

AURELIO
Fine.

BEATRIX
And the lilies.

AURELIO
Beatrix.

BEATRIX
Yes?

AURELIO
Whose wedding is it?

BEATRIX
Mine, in a way. My sister's. Eleven o'clock.

AURELIO
Ours is eleven too.

They look at each other. Jun rolls past again, in the other direction, headphones still on, humming.
